{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"gerry-south","name":"Gerry South","birthDate":"","birthPlace":"","bio":"Gerry is a working Vancouver actor who has numerous credits in film, television and theatre. He attended the Ryerson Theatre School in Toronto and has trained in Los Angeles with some of the city's top casting directors. A student of acting , he constantly seeks to challenge himself to grow his skills.\n\nGerry South is known for Deadpool 2 (2018), Beyond the Black Rainbow (2010) and Jeremiah (2002).","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:43:15+00:00","tmdbId":168520,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/168520","credits":[{"id":"deadpool-2","title":"Deadpool 2","character":"Tree Trimmer #2"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/gerry-south.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Resident Alien","year":2021,"character":"Boat Rental Manager","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5van3ktOTqWr5lcixh5aR8NlqqW.jpg"},{"name":"Schmigadoon!","year":2021,"character":"Judge","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/s2Z5Rm7H0DFHX8cF0CQjIFOd6Am.jpg"},{"name":"Once Upon a Deadpool","year":2018,"character":"Tree Trimmer #2","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/w6Jk8BHohhoKBUcxGeSyDQGWGWc.jpg"},{"name":"Deadpool 2","year":2018,"character":"Tree Trimmer #2","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gyfPKfFYcVW54MoqhYlwwDDIfJR.jpg"},{"name":"The Lost Wife of Robert Durst","year":2017,"character":"Tim Martin","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tYxfo1AvRkeuu4nlKdcNae8MMib.jpg"},{"name":"Cop and a Half: New Recruit","year":2017,"character":"Slim","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7oxV17djCcUE2xFgrL5YE7RedX.jpg"},{"name":"The Flash","year":2014,"character":"Night Manager","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yZevl2vHQgmosfwUdVNzviIfaWS.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond the Black Rainbow","year":2010,"character":"Skinny Hesher","mediaType